# Build context is ./supervisor and serves BOTH builds: the supervisor image
# (Dockerfile) and the agent image (Dockerfile.agent). Never exclude `agent/` —
# wave 2's Dockerfile.agent COPYs agent/mcp-proxy.mjs from this same context.
node_modules
.env
test/
docs/
# Build artifacts: exclude every tar, then put the agent image back — later lines win,
# so `!agent-image.tar` re-includes what `*.tar` just dropped (and the supervisor
# Dockerfile's `COPY agent-image.tar /opt/agent-image.tar` keeps working).
*.tar
!agent-image.tar
